t}\\n\\t}\\n}\\nfragment baseAnime on Media {\\n\\tid\\n\\tidMal\\n\\tsiteUrl\\n\\tstatus(version: 2)\\n\\tseason\\n\\ttype\\n\\tformat\\n\\tseasonYear\\n\\tbannerImage\\n\\tepisodes\\n\\tsynonyms\\n\\tisAdult\\n\\tcountryOfOrigin\\n\\tmeanScore\\n\\tdescription\\n\\tgenres\\n\\tduration\\n\\ttrailer {\\n\\t\\tid\\n\\t\\tsite\\n\\t\\tthumbnail\\n\\t}\\n\\ttitle {\\n\\t\\tuserPreferred\\n\\t\\tromaji\\n\\t\\tenglish\\n\\t\\tnative\\n\\t}\\n\\tcoverImage {\\n\\t\\textraLarge\\n\\t\\tlarge\\n\\t\\tmedium\\n\\t\\tcolor\\n\\t}\\n\\tstartDate {\\n\\t\\tyear\\n\\t\\tmonth\\n\\t\\tday\\n\\t}\\n\\tendDate {\\n\\t\\tyear\\n\\t\\tmonth\\n\\t\\tday\\n\\t}\\n\\tnextAiringEpisode {\\n\\t\\tairingAt\\n\\t\\ttimeUntilAiring\\n\\t\\tepisode\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\",\"variables\":{\"genres\":[\"Ecchi\"],\"page\":1,\"perPage\":20,\"sort\":[\"TRENDING_DESC\"]}}":{"value":{"Page":{"media":[{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/190704-bLXpyNFVZbss.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#3586ff","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx190704-Ts1VvkrNdnCZ.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx190704-Ts1VvkrNdnCZ.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx190704-Ts1VvkrNdnCZ.jpg"},"description":"Kanan, a female demon, infiltrates a high school with the goal of devouring some delicious human souls. She sets her sights on the perfect target, a teen boy named Kyougi Youji, and goes for the kill—only to somehow end up in a relationship with him instead?! Kanan’s never been in love before, and this oddly innocent demon creates absolute chaos as the two venture into romance with a first date and beyond!\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Crunchyroll)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":21,"month":6,"year":2026},"episodes":12,"format":"TV","genres":["Comedy","Ecchi","Fantasy","Romance"],"id":190704,"idMal":61501,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":68,"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1781971200,"episode":12,"timeUntilAiring":412622},"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2026,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/190704","startDate":{"day":5,"month":4,"year":2026},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":["Kanan-sama Is Easy as Hell!","KanaChoro","カナチョロ","Mistress Kanan is Devilishly Easy","ท่านคานัน ปีศาจต๊อง บ๊องไม่มีใครเกิน","Канан до чёртиков проста"],"title":{"english":"Mistress Kanan is Devilishly Easy","native":"カナン様はあくまでチョロい","romaji":"Kanan-sama wa Akumade Choroi","userPreferred":"Mistress Kanan is Devilishly Easy"},"trailer":{"id":"y6whkkkv6kU","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/y6whkkkv6kU/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/182483-Nzix9ntq3CVj.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#50bbf1","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx182483-La7chs6htDWr.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx182483-La7chs6htDWr.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx182483-La7chs6htDWr.jpg"},"description":"Serafina, the West’s fiercest knight, expected torture when captured by barbarians. Instead, she got a marriage proposal! Marrying her sworn enemy is a hard no! But after seeing her wedding captor’s culture and very pretty face, she may be tempted to swap her sword for a wedding veil. Get ready for the ultimate enemies-to-maybe-lovers arc.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Crunchyroll)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":25,"month":6,"year":2026},"episodes":12,"format":"TV","genres":["Comedy","Ecchi","Fantasy","Romance"],"id":182483,"idMal":60028,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":68,"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1781785800,"episode":11,"timeUntilAiring":227222},"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2026,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/182483","startDate":{"day":9,"month":4,"year":2026},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":["The Barbarian’s Bride","The Bride of Barbaroi","Himekishi wa Barbaroi no Yome","バルよめ","BaruYome","Принцесса-рыцарь — невеста варвара"],"title":{"english":"The Warrior Princess and the Barbaric King","native":"姫騎士は蛮族の嫁","romaji":"Hime Kishi wa Barbaroi no Yome","userPreferred":"The Warrior Princess and the Barbaric King"},"trailer":{"id":"oGSDv7XSZA4","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/oGSDv7XSZA4/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/132405-LnPQaqaksEpN.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e46b5d","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx132405-qP7FQYGmNI3d.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx132405-qP7FQYGmNI3d.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx132405-qP7FQYGmNI3d.jpg"},"description":"High schooler Wakana Gojou cares about one thing: making Hina dolls. With nobody to share his obsession, he has trouble finding friends—or even holding conversation. But after the school’s most popular girl, Marin Kitagawa, reveals a secret of her own, he discovers a new purpose for his sewing skills. Together, they’ll make her cosplay dreams come true! \u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Funimation)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":27,"month":3,"year":2022},"episodes":12,"format":"TV","genres":["Comedy","Ecchi","Romance","Slice of Life"],"id":132405,"idMal":48736,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":80,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"season":"WINTER","seasonYear":2022,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/132405","startDate":{"day":9,"month":1,"year":2022},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["Sono Kisekae Ningyou wa Koi wo suru","หนุ่มเย็บผ้ากับสาวนักคอสเพลย์","その着せ替え人形（ビスク・ドール）は恋をする","kisekoi","Si Boneka Rias Sedang Jatuh Cinta","Projekt: cosplay","Любовь с иголочки","着せ恋","Oyuncak Bebek Sevgilim","Nàng Búp Bê Thử Đồ Biết Yêu"],"title":{"english":"My Dress-Up Darling","native":"その着せ替え人形は恋をする","romaji":"Sono Bisque Doll wa Koi wo Suru","userPreferred":"My Dress-Up Darling"},"trailer":{"id":"8oveGY6h6T8","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/8oveGY6h6T8/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/108465-RgsRpTMhP9Sv.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#43a1e4","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx108465-1ANspF1EWyFx.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx108465-1ANspF1EWyFx.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx108465-1ANspF1EWyFx.jpg"},"description":"When a 34-year-old underachiever gets run over by a bus, his story doesn’t end there. Reincarnated in a new world as an infant, Rudeus will seize every opportunity to live the life he’s always wanted. Armed with new friends, some freshly acquired magical abilities, and the courage to do the things he’s always dreamed of, he’s embarking on an epic adventure—with all of his past experience intact!\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Funimation, edited)\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003ci\u003eNote: The anime pre-screened its 1st and 2nd episode starting on the 27th of December on the Nico Nico Live Broadcasting and D Anime Store services\u003ci/\u003e","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":22,"month":3,"year":2021},"episodes":11,"format":"TV","genres":["Adventure","Drama","Ecchi","Fantasy"],"id":108465,"idMal":39535,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":82,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"season":"WINTER","seasonYear":2021,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/108465","startDate":{"day":11,"month":1,"year":2021},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["Jobless Reincarnation: I Will Seriously Try If I Go To Another World","无职转生 ~到了异世界就拿出真本事~","เกิดชาตินี้พี่ต้องเทพ","Thất nghiệp chuyển sinh"],"title":{"english":"Mushoku Tensei: Jobless Reincarnation","native":"無職転生 ～異世界行ったら本気だす～","romaji":"Mushoku Tensei: Isekai Ittara Honki Dasu","userPreferred":"Mushoku Tensei: Jobless Reincarnation"},"trailer":{"id":"JoS7Z8MCD6E","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/JoS7Z8MCD6E/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/185211-2wkjFD6tz7l3.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#f1bbae","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx185211-ewfgT5Cn99k0.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx185211-ewfgT5Cn99k0.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx185211-ewfgT5Cn99k0.jpg"},"description":"High school homeroom teacher Hiyori Hiwamura is known as the “Scary Teacher,” and if you offend her, she’ll put a curse on you! Or at least that’s what everyone believes. She’s secretly a total softy who’s deeply misunderstood, and once you see her sweet side, she’ll put a different kind of spell on you... Unfortunately, one of her students, Akihito Abikura, has accidentally discovered her secret.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: HIDIVE)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":null,"month":null,"year":null},"episodes":12,"format":"TV","genres":["Comedy","Ecchi","Romance"],"id":185211,"idMal":60444,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":62,"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1781958600,"episode":11,"timeUntilAiring":400022},"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2026,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/185211","startDate":{"day":11,"month":4,"year":2026},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":["YowaYowa Teacher","คุณครูมาดหลอน หัวใจอ่อนแอ"],"title":{"english":"Yowayowa Sensei","native":"よわよわ先生","romaji":"Yowa Yowa Sensei","userPreferred":"Yowayowa Sensei"},"trailer":{"id":"UfkutRs8RHM","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/UfkutRs8RHM/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/127720-oBpHiMWQhFVN.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#d6bb1a","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx127720-ADJgIrUVMdU9.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx127720-ADJgIrUVMdU9.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx127720-ADJgIrUVMdU9.jpg"},"description":"After the mysterious mana calamity, Rudeus Greyrat and his fierce student Eris Boreas Greyrat are teleported to the Demon Continent. There, they team up with their newfound companion Ruijerd Supardia—the former leader of the Superd's Warrior group—to form \"Dead End,\" a successful adventurer party. Making a name for themselves, the trio journeys across the continent to make their way back home to Fittoa.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nFollowing the advice he received from the faceless god Hitogami, Rudeus saves Kishirika Kishirisu, the Great Emperor of the Demon World, who rewards him by granting him a strange power. Now, as Rudeus masters the powerful ability that offers a number of new opportunities, it might prove to be more than what he bargained for when unexpected dangers threaten to hinder their travels.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":20,"month":12,"year":2021},"episodes":12,"format":"TV","genres":["Adventure","Drama","Ecchi","Fantasy"],"id":127720,"idMal":45576,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":85,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"season":"FALL","seasonYear":2021,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/127720","startDate":{"day":4,"month":10,"year":2021},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["Mushoku Tensei: Jobless Reincarnation Part 2","เกิดชาตินี้พี่ต้องเทพ พาร์ท 2"],"title":{"english":"Mushoku Tensei: Jobless Reincarnation Cour 2","native":"無職転生 ～異世界行ったら本気だす～ 第2クール","romaji":"Mushoku Tensei: Isekai Ittara Honki Dasu Part 2","userPreferred":"Mushoku Tensei: Jobless Reincarnation Cour 2"},"trailer":{"id":"vPBU0xBjFFY","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/vPBU0xBjFFY/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/154768-EuZd63IcqsVq.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e4a15d","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx154768-DHHvNd4MjV1p.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx154768-DHHvNd4MjV1p.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx154768-DHHvNd4MjV1p.jpg"},"description":"The second season of \u003ci\u003eSono Bisque Doll wa Koi wo Suru\u003c/i\u003e.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nWhen Marin Kitagawa and Wakana Gojo met, they grew close over their love for cosplay. Through interacting with classmates and making new cosplay friends, Marin and Wakana’s world keeps growing. New developments arise as Marin’s love for Wakana continues to be filled with endless excitement. In their ever-expanding world, Marin and Wakana’s story of cosplay and thrills continues!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Crunchyroll)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":21,"month":9,"year":2025},"episodes":12,"format":"TV","genres":["Comedy","Ecchi","Romance","Slice of Life"],"id":154768,"idMal":53065,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":82,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2025,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/154768","startDate":{"day":6,"month":7,"year":2025},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["Sono Kisekae Ningyou wa Koi wo suru","หนุ่มเย็บผ้ากับสาวนักคอสเพลย์ ภาค 2","その着せ替え人形（ビスク・ドール）は恋をする","Kisekoi 2","Si Boneka Rias Sedang Jatuh Cinta","着せ恋 2"],"title":{"english":"My Dress-Up Darling Season 2","native":"その着せ替え人形は恋をする Season 2","romaji":"Sono Bisque Doll wa Koi wo Suru Season 2","userPreferred":"My Dress-Up Darling Season 2"},"trailer":{"id":"Gx1QvE0wtgw","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Gx1QvE0wtgw/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":null,"countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#281a6b","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx206166-xTJ9h6RmMCKR.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx206166-xTJ9h6RmMCKR.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx206166-xTJ9h6RmMCKR.jpg"},"description":"It's a place where greedy wives live... A married woman's erotic suspense!\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nThis is the extreme suspense of a married woman by the author of \u003ci\u003eLibido Hunter Takeru\u003c/i\u003e! In this story, a group of perverted married women wearing the mysterious \"libido cross\" costume that amplifies human desires come under attack! Protect the apartment complex from the threat of perverted wives, new janitor Yoshida!","duration":3,"endDate":{"day":null,"month":null,"year":null},"episodes":12,"format":"TV_SHORT","genres":["Ecchi"],"id":206166,"idMal":63310,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":49,"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1782058200,"episode":12,"timeUntilAiring":499622},"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2026,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/206166","startDate":{"day":6,"month":4,"year":2026},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":["Perverts' Apartment Complex ","淫獄団地"],"title":{"english":"Ingoku Danchi:Deviant's Apartment Complex","native":"インゴクダンチ","romaji":"Ingoku Danchi","userPreferred":"Ingoku Danchi:Deviant's Apartment Complex"},"trailer":{"id":"MkI3yiYeE2c","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/MkI3yiYeE2c/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":null,"countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e4bb35","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx204319-qhw2yBXBUgJT.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx204319-qhw2yBXBUgJT.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx204319-qhw2yBXBUgJT.png"},"description":"Souta was suddenly made dorm manager and coach of the Hokuei University Women's Volleyball Club as prompted by his older sister, Kaori. There, he had a fateful reunion with Ayano, his first love... In the girls' dorm! In the gym! In a hotel?! What awaited him were days of being bossed around by girls bigger than him! A Happy Harem Rom-Com of Size Differences♡ Born Huge on the Northern Plains!!\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: OceanVeil)\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003ci\u003eNote: Episode 1 received an advanced distribution on AnimeFesta on March 13th, 2026. The start date reflects the start of the regular series broadcasting.\u003c/i\u003e","duration":4,"endDate":{"day":null,"month":null,"year":null},"episodes":12,"format":"TV_SHORT","genres":["Ecchi","Romance","Sports"],"id":204319,"idMal":63248,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":59,"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1782057900,"episode":12,"timeUntilAiring":499322},"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2026,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/204319","startDate":{"day":6,"month":4,"year":2026},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":[],"title":{"english":"Do You Like Big Girls?","native":"大きい女の子は好きですか？","romaji":"Ookii Onnanoko wa Suki desu ka?","userPreferred":"Do You Like Big Girls?"},"trailer":{"id":"lykS0V2dnWY","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/lykS0V2dnWY/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/146065-33RDijfuxLLk.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#35aee4","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx146065-IjirxRK26O03.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx146065-IjirxRK26O03.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx146065-IjirxRK26O03.png"},"description":"After his relationship with Eris Boreas Greyrat reaches new heights, Rudeus Greyrat is ecstatic. Unfortunately, his joy is short-lived, as Eris suddenly abandons him to embark on her own journey. Believing that Eris has lost all interest in him, a heartbroken and depressed Rudeus sets forth to the Northern Territories. With his sole goal being to locate his mother on the vast continent, Rudeus wonders if persisting through daily life is worth the pain, falling into a robotic routine as he endlessly ruminates on his lost love.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nHowever, the dangers of the North soon prove that one cannot survive with a dulled mind. While on a quest with the party Counter Arrow, with whom he recently became acquainted, Rudeus has a brush with death—an experience that forces him to finally snap out of his despair. With his newfound teammates, Rudeus rediscovers the pleasure of daily adventuring and moves forward with his original goal of living his second lease on life to the fullest.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003ci\u003eNote: Includes episode 0, Shugo Jutsushi Fitz.\u003c/i\u003e","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":25,"month":9,"year":2023},"episodes":13,"format":"TV","genres":["Adventure","Drama","Ecchi","Fantasy"],"id":146065,"idMal":51179,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":81,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2023,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/146065","startDate":{"day":3,"month":7,"year":2023},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["เกิดชาตินี้พี่ต้องเทพ ซีซั่น 2","Mushoku Tensei: Isekai Ittara Honki Dasu 2nd Season","Mushoku Tensei II: Jobless Reincarnation","Mushoku Tensei II: Reencarnación desde cero","无职转生～到了异世界就拿出真本事～第2季"],"title":{"english":"Mushoku Tensei: Jobless Reincarnation Season 2","native":"無職転生Ⅱ ～異世界行ったら本気だす～","romaji":"Mushoku Tensei II: Isekai Ittara Honki Dasu","userPreferred":"Mushoku Tensei: Jobless Reincarnation Season 2"},"trailer":{"id":"ts5NGoDI1V0","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ts5NGoDI1V0/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/141949-37BoBF129jLT.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#d6e45d","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx141949-tViCIRHPZAyG.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx141949-tViCIRHPZAyG.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx141949-tViCIRHPZAyG.jpg"},"description":"Third-year high school student Jirou Yakuin hoped to partner with Shiori Sakurazaka of the same class in the mandatory \"Couple Practical\" course. In this practical, students must demonstrate that they have the necessary skillset to live with a partner of the opposite sex while presenting a certain level of harmony to the video surveillance that grades them.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\nUnfortunately, random chance put his slightly subdued self into the practical with the person polar opposite to him, the gyaru Akari Watanabe. Akari on the other hand hoped to be paired with her crush Minami Tenjin.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\nTheir hopes are doubly dashed when they find out that Shiori and Minami are assigned together. Thus, they reluctantly decide to cooperate to reach the top ten, which would give them the right to exchange partners if both couples agree. To that end, Jirou steals Akari's first kiss without realizing what he'd done, while giving a hurried good-bye kiss...","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":25,"month":12,"year":2022},"episodes":12,"format":"TV","genres":["Comedy","Drama","Ecchi","Romance"],"id":141949,"idMal":50425,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":76,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"season":"FALL","seasonYear":2022,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/141949","startDate":{"day":9,"month":10,"year":2022},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["More than a Couple, Less than Lovers.","แผนสมรสไม่สมเลิฟ","Presque mariés, loin d'être amoureux.","Больше чем пара, меньше чем любовники","Fuukoi","ふうこい"],"title":{"english":"More than a Married Couple, but Not Lovers.","native":"夫婦以上、恋人未満。","romaji":"Fuufu Ijou, Koibito Miman.","userPreferred":"More than a Married Couple, but Not Lovers."},"trailer":{"id":"2gHhxAksU9E","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/2gHhxAksU9E/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/141821-KIRWH28jXINm.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e45035","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx141821-lkVTjKqL4BU2.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx141821-lkVTjKqL4BU2.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx141821-lkVTjKqL4BU2.jpg"},"description":"Yuuki Wakura watches as dueling supernatural forces ravage the Earth. Mato are portals to another dimension, avenues from which dangerous monsters escape. Peaches are resources given to women granting them abilities. Chief of the Seventh Unity of the Anti-Demon Corp, Kyouka Uzen arrives to save Yuuki from a monster. Surprisingly, Yuuki holds the power to increase the Peaches effectiveness. But to save the world, Yuuki must be willing to become Kyouka’s servant both on the battlefield and at home.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: HIDIVE)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":21,"month":3,"year":2024},"episodes":12,"format":"TV","genres":["Action","Adventure","Drama","Ecchi","Fantasy","Romance"],"id":141821,"idMal":50392,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":67,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"season":"WINTER","seasonYear":2024,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/141821","startDate":{"day":4,"month":1,"year":2024},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["Slave of the Magic Capital's Elite Troops","Demon Slave","Slave of the Hell Soldiers","ทาสสุดแกร่งแห่งหน่วยป้องกันอสูร","Mabotai","Demon Slave: The Chained Soldier","Budak Korps Elite Kota Sihir"],"title":{"english":"Chained Soldier","native":"魔都精兵のスレイブ","romaji":"Mato Seihei no Slave","userPreferred":"Chained Soldier"},"trailer":{"id":"NdWFitNUsMw","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/NdWFitNUsMw/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/166873-GTi5imE5skM2.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#6b431a","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx166873-xO0BRPkmwFll.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx166873-xO0BRPkmwFll.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx166873-xO0BRPkmwFll.png"},"description":"The second cour of \u003ci\u003eMushoku Tensei II: Isekai Ittara Honki Dasu\u003c/i\u003e.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nFollowing the faceless god Hitogami's advice seems to have worked wonders for Rudeus Greyrat. After enrolling into the University of Magic as he was told, Rudeus reunites with his childhood friend Sylphiette, who put a valiant effort into curing his condition. The two grow ever closer together and decide to host a wedding party, inviting the friends they have made over the years to announce and formalize their relationship.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nFor all his recent blessings, however, Rudeus' troubles are far from over. The research he is helping Shizuka Nanahoshi conduct hits a bottleneck, sending her into a deep slump much like he experienced in his previous life. Furthermore, a letter from his father, Paul, brings complications to Rudeus' relationships, and Sylphiette still knows next to nothing about his real background. In the face of these issues, Rudeus will have to apply the lessons he has learned in this new world to navigate through the challenges that come with living a life to its fullest.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":1,"month":7,"year":2024},"episodes":12,"format":"TV","genres":["Adventure","Drama","Ecchi","Fantasy"],"id":166873,"idMal":55888,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":83,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2024,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/166873","startDate":{"day":8,"month":4,"year":2024},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["Mushoku Tensei: Jobless Reincarnation Season 2 Cour 2","เกิดชาตินี้พี่ต้องเทพ ซีซั่น 2 ครึ่งหลัง","Mushoku Tensei: Isekai Ittara Honki Dasu 2nd Season Part 2","Mushoku Tensei II: Jobless Reincarnation Part 2","Mushoku Tensei II: Reencarnación desde cero","无职转生～到了异世界就拿出真本事～第2季"],"title":{"english":"Mushoku Tensei: Jobless Reincarnation Season 2 Part 2","native":"無職転生Ⅱ ～異世界行ったら本気だす～ 第2クール","romaji":"Mushoku Tensei II: Isekai Ittara Honki Dasu Part 2","userPreferred":"Mushoku Tensei: Jobless Reincarnation Season 2 Part 2"},"trailer":{"id":"wwKZYTsxIhk","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/wwKZYTsxIhk/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/162694-PzaToQuFdpsr.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#28aee4","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx162694-QFBei5pbjSh8.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx162694-QFBei5pbjSh8.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx162694-QFBei5pbjSh8.png"},"description":"Rentarou Aijou was rejected 100 times in middle school. He visits a shrine and prays for better luck in high school. The God of Love appears and promises that he’ll soon meet 100 people he’s destined to date. But there’s a catch—once destiny introduces someone to him, the two must happily love each other. If they don’t, they’ll die. What will befall Rentarou and his 100 girlfriends in high school?\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Crunchyroll) ","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":24,"month":12,"year":2023},"episodes":12,"format":"TV","genres":["Comedy","Ecchi","Romance"],"id":162694,"idMal":54714,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":76,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"season":"FALL","seasonYear":2023,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/162694","startDate":{"day":8,"month":10,"year":2023},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["100 Kanojo","100Kano","Hyakkano","100 Namoradas Que Te Amam Muuuuuito","Les 100 petites amies qui t'aiiiment à en mourir","100 Pacar yang Sungguh Sangat Amat Benar-benar Mencintaimu","100 девушек, которые очень-очень-очень-очень-очень сильно тебя любят","100 Cô Bạn Gái Yêu Bạn Rất Rất Rất Rất Rất Nhiều"],"title":{"english":"The 100 Girlfriends Who Really, Really, Really, Really, REALLY Love You","native":"君のことが大大大大大好きな100人の彼女","romaji":"Kimi no Koto ga Dai Dai Dai Dai Daisuki na 100-nin no Kanojo","userPreferred":"The 100 Girlfriends Who Really, Really, Really, Really, REALLY Love You"},"trailer":{"id":"ls2VNcSifi4","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ls2VNcSifi4/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21699-1PwL1P4i61wP.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#f1a150","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx21699-Fkbnkl9ZC6fW.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx21699-Fkbnkl9ZC6fW.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx21699-Fkbnkl9ZC6fW.png"},"description":"When Kazuma Satou died, he was given two choices: pass on to heaven or be revived in a fantasy world. After choosing the new world, the goddess Aqua tasked him with defeating the Demon King, and let him choose any weapon to aid him. Unfortunately, Kazuma chose to bring Aqua herself and has regretted the decision ever since then.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nNot only is he stuck with a useless deity turned party archpriest, the pair also has to make enough money for living expenses. To add to their problems, their group continued to grow as more problematic adventurers joined their ranks. Their token spellcaster, Megumin, is an explosion magic specialist who can only cast one spell once per day and refuses to learn anything else. There is also their stalwart crusader, Lalatina \"Darkness\" Dustiness Ford, a helpless masochist who makes Kazuma look pure in comparison.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003ci\u003eKono Subarashii Sekai ni Shukufuku wo! 2\u003c/i\u003e continues to follow Kazuma and the rest of his party through countless more adventures as they struggle to earn money and have to deal with one another's problematic personalities. However, things rarely go as planned, and they are often sidetracked by their own idiotic tendencies.\n","duration":23,"endDate":{"day":16,"month":3,"year":2017},"episodes":10,"format":"TV","genres":["Adventure","Comedy","Ecchi","Fantasy"],"id":21699,"idMal":32937,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":81,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"season":"WINTER","seasonYear":2017,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/21699","startDate":{"day":12,"month":1,"year":2017},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["Konosuba 2","Konosuba! - As Bençãos de Deus Neste Mundo Maravilhoso 2!","为美好的世界献上祝福！2","为美好的世界献上祝福第二季","ขอให้โชคดีมีชัยในโลกแฟนตาซี! ภาค 2","Konosuba : Une explosion dans ce monde merveilleux !","Да благословят боги сей расчудесный мир! 2","Konosuba! Un mundo maravilloso 2"],"title":{"english":"KONOSUBA -God's blessing on this wonderful world! 2","native":"この素晴らしい世界に祝福を！2","romaji":"Kono Subarashii Sekai ni Shukufuku wo! 2","userPreferred":"KONOSUBA -God's blessing on this wonderful world! 2"},"trailer":{"id":"9jVxMt845AY","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9jVxMt845AY/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20789-qwG9GcxIrmVE.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e4861a","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx20789-Ma5ouSYPkru9.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx20789-Ma5ouSYPkru9.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx20789-Ma5ouSYPkru9.jpg"},"description":"When they were accused of trying to overthrow the monarchy, the feared warriors the Seven Deadly Sins were sent into exile. Princess Elizabeth discovers the truth - the Sins were framed by the king's guard, the Holy Knights - too late to prevent them from assassinating her father and seizing the throne!\u003cbr\u003e\nNow the princess is on the run, seeking the Sins to help her reclaim the kingdom. But the first Sin she meets, Meliodas, is a little innkeeper with a talking pig. He doesn't even have a real sword! Have the legends of the Sins' strength been exaggerated?\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Anime News Network)","duration":25,"endDate":{"day":29,"month":3,"year":2015},"episodes":24,"format":"TV","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Ecchi","Fantasy","Supernatural"],"id":20789,"idMal":23755,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":73,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"season":"FALL","seasonYear":2014,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/20789","startDate":{"day":5,"month":10,"year":2014},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["七大罪","ศึกตำนาน 7 อัศวิน","7DS","Семь смертных грехов"],"title":{"english":"The Seven Deadly Sins","native":"七つの大罪","romaji":"Nanatsu no Taizai","userPreferred":"The Seven Deadly Sins"},"trailer":{"id":"wxcvbL6o55M","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/wxcvbL6o55M/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":null,"countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e44378","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx202523-NHeyiypiPnGP.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx202523-NHeyiypiPnGP.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx202523-NHeyiypiPnGP.jpg"},"description":"Confessing to my childhood friend Marika was impossible for someone as unpopular as me. So, I did what any desperate boy would do—I wished upon a shooting star! When I woke up, that dream had come true?! I could see a love meter for people, just like in a love simulation game. Once I realized this was real and not a dream I went straight to see Marika. Her love meter was so low it had broken and practically fallen all the way to hell! If she hated me so much why was she so nice?! Is this how she really felt or...?!\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Coolmic)\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003ci\u003eNote: Episode 1 received an advanced distribution on AnimeFesta on March 13th, 2026. The start date reflects the start of the regular series broadcasting.\u003c/i\u003e","duration":6,"endDate":{"day":8,"month":6,"year":2026},"episodes":8,"format":"TV_SHORT","genres":["Comedy","Drama","Ecchi","Romance","Supernatural"],"id":202523,"idMal":62983,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":47,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2026,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/202523","startDate":{"day":6,"month":4,"year":2026},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":[],"title":{"english":"Marika's Love Meter Malfunction","native":"茉莉花ちゃんの好感度はぶっ壊れている","romaji":"Marika-chan no Koukando wa Bukkowareteiru","userPreferred":"Marika's Love Meter Malfunction"},"trailer":{"id":"Ohd23eSaOaw","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Ohd23eSaOaw/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":null,"countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#35bbe4","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx178789-Gam1EpzXlrUv.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx178789-Gam1EpzXlrUv.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx178789-Gam1EpzXlrUv.png"},"description":"The third season of \u003ci\u003eMushoku Tensei: Isekai Ittara Honki Dasu\u003c/i\u003e.","duration":null,"endDate":{"day":null,"month":null,"year":null},"episodes":null,"format":"TV","genres":["Adventure","Drama","Ecchi","Fantasy"],"id":178789,"idMal":59193,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":null,"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1783263600,"episode":1,"timeUntilAiring":1705022},"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2026,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/178789","startDate":{"day":6,"month":7,"year":2026},"status":"NOT_YET_RELEASED","synonyms":["Mushoku Tensei: Jobless Reincarnation Season 3","無職転生 ～異世界行ったら本気だす～ 第3期","Mushoku Tensei: Isekai Ittara Honki Dasu 3rd Season"],"title":{"english":"Mushoku Tensei: Jobless Reincarnation Season 3","native":"無職転生Ⅲ ～異世界行ったら本気だす～","romaji":"Mushoku Tensei III: Isekai Ittara Honki Dasu","userPreferred":"Mushoku Tensei: Jobless Reincarnation Season 3"},"trailer":{"id":"ODxfIvSgWuo","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ODxfIvSgWuo/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/176276-ES97CHqKSrLg.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#f1505d","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx176276-rtF8mYd2OWw2.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx176276-rtF8mYd2OWw2.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx176276-rtF8mYd2OWw2.png"},"description":"The second season of \u003ci\u003eMato Seihei no Slave.\u003c/i\u003e","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":26,"month":3,"year":2026},"episodes":12,"format":"TV","genres":["Action","Adventure","Drama","Ecchi","Fantasy","Romance"],"id":176276,"idMal":58505,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":74,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"season":"WINTER","seasonYear":2026,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/176276","startDate":{"day":8,"month":1,"year":2026},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["Mabotai 2","魔都精兵のスレイブ 第２期","Mato Seihei no Slave 2nd Season","ทาสสุดแกร่งแห่งหน่วยป้องกันอสูร ซีซั่น 2","Demon Slave Temporada 2"],"title":{"english":"Chained Soldier Season 2","native":"魔都精兵のスレイブ2","romaji":"Mato Seihei no Slave 2","userPreferred":"Chained Soldier Season 2"},"trailer":{"id":"IDgkCjcNxtU","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/IDgkCjcNxtU/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/136804-yHC8D64UTiRA.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#3586e4","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx136804-7FVftG67FPBc.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx136804-7FVftG67FPBc.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx136804-7FVftG67FPBc.jpg"},"description":"The third season of \u003ci\u003eKono Subarashii Sekai ni Shukufuku wo! \u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nThe dysfunctional party is back, but they may be short a member soon ’cause Kazuma is over it. Disillusioned with adventure, he wants to become a monk, but Aqua, Megumin, and Darkness call bull. However, the career dispute gets put on hold when a princess requests to hear all about their tales. Will the taste of fame at the royal castle keep them together or will this mark their farewell tour?\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":19,"month":6,"year":2024},"episodes":11,"format":"TV","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Ecchi","Fantasy"],"id":136804,"idMal":49458,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":82,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2024,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/136804","startDate":{"day":10,"month":4,"year":2024},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["Konosuba 3","ขอให้โชคดีมีชัยในโลกแฟนตาซี! ภาค 3","為美好的世界獻上祝福！3","Да благословят боги сей расчудесный мир! 3","Konosuba! Un mundo maravilloso 3"],"title":{"english":"KONOSUBA -God's blessing on this wonderful world! 3","native":"この素晴らしい世界に祝福を！３","romaji":"Kono Subarashii Sekai ni Shukufuku wo! 3","userPreferred":"KONOSUBA -God's blessing on this wonderful world! 3"},"trailer":{"id":"Meo3mO98huE","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Meo3mO98huE/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}],"pageInfo":{"currentPage":1,"hasNextPage":true,"lastPage":250,"perPage":20,"total":5000}}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T02:52:59.212152312+05:30"},"{\"query\":\"query ListAnime ($page: Int, $search: String, $perPage: Int, $sort: [MediaSort], $status: [MediaStatus], $genres: [String], $tags: [String], $averageScore_greater: Int, $season: MediaSeason, $seasonYear: Int, $format: MediaFormat, $isAdult: Boolean) {\\n\\tPage(page: $page, perPage: $perPage) {\\n\\t\\tpageInfo {\\n\\t\\t\\thasNextPage\\n\\t\\t\\ttotal\\n\\t\\t\\tperPage\\n\\t\\t\\tcurrentPage\\n\\t\\t\\tlastPage\\n\\t\\t}\\n\\t\\tmedia(type: ANIME, search: $search, sort: $sort, status_in: $status, isAdult: $isAdult, format: $format, genre_in: $genres, tag_in: $tags, averageScore_greater: $averageScore_greater, season: $season, seasonYear: $seasonYear, format_not: MUSIC) {\\n\\t\\t\\t... baseAnime\\n\\t\\t}\\n\\t}\\n}\\nfragment baseAnime on Media {\\n\\tid\\n\\tidMal\\n\\tsiteUrl\\n\\tstatus(version: 2)\\n\\tseason\\n\\ttype\\n\\tformat\\n\\tseasonYear\\n\\tbannerImage\\n\\tepisodes\\n\\tsynonyms\\n\\tisAdult\\n\\tcountryOfOrigin\\n\\tmeanScore\\n\\tdescription\\n\\tgenres\\n\\tduration\\n\\ttrailer {\\n\\t\\tid\\n\\t\\tsite\\n\\t\\tthumbnail\\n\\t}\\n\\ttitle {\\n\\t\\tuserPreferred\\n\\t\\tromaji\\n\\t\\tenglish\\n\\t\\tnative\\n\\t}\\n\\tcoverImage {\\n\\t\\textraLarge\\n\\t\\tlarge\\n\\t\\tmedium\\n\\t\\tcolor\\n\\t}\\n\\tstartDate {\\n\\t\\tyear\\n\\t\\tmonth\\n\\t\\tday\\n\\t}\\n\\tendDate {\\n\\t\\tyear\\n\\t\\tmonth\\n\\t\\tday\\n\\t}\\n\\tnextAiringEpisode {\\n\\t\\tairingAt\\n\\t\\ttimeUntilAiring\\n\\t\\tepisode\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\",\"variables\":{\"isAdult\":false,\"page\":1,\"perPage\":48,\"search\":\"uma musume\",\"sort\":[\"SEARCH_MATCH\",\"SCORE_DESC\"]}}":{"value":{"Page":{"media":[{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/98514-0uYzay4a1iiL.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e47850","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx98514-mEh3Gl58AWgc.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx98514-mEh3Gl58AWgc.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx98514-mEh3Gl58AWgc.jpg"},"description":"In a world very much like our own, great race horses of the past have a chance to be reborn as \"horse girls\"—girls with the ears and tails of horses as well as their speed and endurance. The best of these horse girls go to train at Tokyo's Tracen Academy, hopefully moving on to fame and fortune as both racers and idols.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nSpecial Week, a high school horse girl from the countryside, has just transferred to Tracen, and she's determined to fulfill her promise to her mother to become the best horse girl in Japan. On her way to school, she takes a pit stop at the race track and instantly falls in love with Silence Suzuka's style, becoming determined to race on the same team as her.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Anime News Network) ","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":18,"month":6,"year":2018},"episodes":13,"format":"TV","genres":["Drama","Music","Slice of Life","Sports"],"id":98514,"idMal":35249,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":73,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2018,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/98514","startDate":{"day":2,"month":4,"year":2018},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["สาวม้าโมเอะ"],"title":{"english":"Umamusume: Pretty Derby","native":"ウマ娘 プリティーダービー","romaji":"Uma Musume: Pretty Derby","userPreferred":"Umamusume: Pretty Derby"},"trailer":{"id":"WlDbeKNVtBo","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/WlDbeKNVtBo/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/103237-jOt5BUijZl6v.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":null,"extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx103237-EFvIy9iLXfYV.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx103237-EFvIy9iLXfYV.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx103237-EFvIy9iLXfYV.jpg"},"description":"Bundled with the television anime's fourth Blu-ray Disc release. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\nIt will center on Narita Taishin, Winning Ticket, and Biwa Hayahide.","duration":25,"endDate":{"day":19,"month":12,"year":2018},"episodes":3,"format":"OVA","genres":["Slice of Life","Sports"],"id":103237,"idMal":37916,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":71,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"season":"FALL","seasonYear":2018,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/103237","startDate":{"day":19,"month":12,"year":2018},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":[],"title":{"english":null,"native":"ウマ娘「BNWの誓い」","romaji":"Uma Musume: BNW no Chikai","userPreferred":"Uma Musume: BNW no Chikai"},"trailer":{"id":"jZURIPVF0PA","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/jZURIPVF0PA/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/180516-qxKVBsTW6Czx.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#1aa1d6","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx180516-lebpoKLkw6E3.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx180516-lebpoKLkw6E3.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx180516-lebpoKLkw6E3.jpg"},"description":"Unbeknownst to those around her in the destitute countryside of Kasamatsu, the staggering potential of this ashen-haired \"Beast” will soon rock Japan with her feet and catapult her to the national stage—down the path of a legend. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nFollow Oguri Cap and her insatiable appetite as the starting gates open on this Umamusume's hot-blooded Cinderella story! \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\n(Source: It's Anime powered by REMOW, edited)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":29,"month":6,"year":2025},"episodes":13,"format":"TV","genres":["Drama","Sports"],"id":180516,"idMal":59636,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":85,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2025,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/180516","startDate":{"day":6,"month":4,"year":2025},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":[],"title":{"english":"Umamusume: Cinderella Gray","native":"ウマ娘 シンデレラグレイ","romaji":"Uma Musume: Cinderella Gray","userPreferred":"Umamusume: Cinderella Gray"},"trailer":{"id":"Gw8j8-m1gVk","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Gw8j8-m1gVk/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/148370-rYivpA9giZYc.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#5086fe","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx148370-db0LjJfaOCg9.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx148370-db0LjJfaOCg9.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx148370-db0LjJfaOCg9.jpg"},"description":"The new anime will depict T.M. Opera O, Admire Vega, Narita Top Road, and other Uma Musume (Horse Girls) going head-to-head to win Classic competitions.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Anime News Network)","duration":25,"endDate":{"day":7,"month":5,"year":2023},"episodes":4,"format":"ONA","genres":["Drama","Slice of Life","Sports"],"id":148370,"idMal":51761,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":80,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2023,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/148370","startDate":{"day":16,"month":4,"year":2023},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["Umamusume: Pretty Derby - Road to the Top","ウマ娘ロードトゥーザトップ","Uma Musume: Pretty Derby RTTT"],"title":{"english":"Umamusume: Pretty Derby - Road to the Top","native":"ウマ娘 プリティーダービー ROAD TO THE TOP","romaji":"Uma Musume: Pretty Derby - ROAD TO THE TOP","userPreferred":"Umamusume: Pretty Derby - Road to the Top"},"trailer":{"id":"SQ7rv98fgH4","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/SQ7rv98fgH4/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/176299-dtVaXMPJWVrF.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#5d86e4","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx176299-9LocW6ylWFhm.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx176299-9LocW6ylWFhm.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx176299-9LocW6ylWFhm.jpg"},"description":"Theatrical version of \u003ci\u003eUma Musume: Pretty Derby - ROAD TO THE TOP\u003c/i\u003e which includes new extra scenes.","duration":99,"endDate":{"day":10,"month":5,"year":2024},"episodes":1,"format":"MOVIE","genres":["Drama","Slice of Life","Sports"],"id":176299,"idMal":58517,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":79,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2024,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/176299","startDate":{"day":10,"month":5,"year":2024},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["ウマ娘ロードトゥーザトップ","Uma Musume: Pretty Derby RTTT"],"title":{"english":null,"native":"ウマ娘 プリティーダービー ROAD TO THE TOP 劇場用再編集版","romaji":"Uma Musume: Pretty Derby - ROAD TO THE TOP Movie","userPreferred":"Uma Musume: Pretty Derby - ROAD TO THE TOP Movie"},"trailer":{"id":"ka62Zuurh-c","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ka62Zuurh-c/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/172420-QVRFOAha7oy5.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#f1bb43","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx172420-4LjhmwpNMHti.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx172420-4LjhmwpNMHti.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx172420-4LjhmwpNMHti.jpg"},"description":"\u003cb\u003eREACH OUT AND GRASP GREATNESS.\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nJungle Pocket, known to her close friends as \"Pokke,\" is a free-spirited Umamusume who has proven her dominance in the freestyle racing scene. Overwhelmed by Fuji Kiseki's majestic performance at a graded Twinkle Series race, she resolves to take on the Twinkle Series herself.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nShortly after joining the Umamusume training school Tracen Academy, Pokke comes under the wing of Tanabe, a veteran trainer who fostered Fuji Kiseki's talent. Together, they aspire to dominate the Triple Crown series, a set of three races that can only be attempted once in a lifetime. Awaiting them are formidable rivals of Pokke's generation, whose talents surpass even her own.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nThere's Dantsu Flame, whose diligence and determination to win are second to none; Manhattan Cafe, who chases the shadowy silhouette of a \"friend\" that only she can see; and Agnes Tachyon, a veritable mad scientist seeking to push the very boundaries of what is possible for Umamusume.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nThese four runners take to the track with their very pride, spirit, and souls on the line. Past the finish of their epic clash is a door waiting to be opened—one that leads to the beginning of a new era.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003ci\u003e\"It doesn't matter who stands in my way! I'm gonna be the greatest!\"\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Umamusume: Pretty Derby - Beginning of a New Era Site)","duration":108,"endDate":{"day":24,"month":5,"year":2024},"episodes":1,"format":"MOVIE","genres":["Drama","Psychological","Slice of Life","Sports"],"id":172420,"idMal":57647,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":87,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2024,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/172420","startDate":{"day":24,"month":5,"year":2024},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["Uma Musume: Pretty Derby Movie","劇場版 ウマ娘 プリティーダービー","ウマ娘 プリティーダービー BEGINNING OF A NEW ERA"],"title":{"english":"Umamusume: Pretty Derby - Beginning of a New Era","native":"ウマ娘 プリティーダービー 新時代の扉","romaji":"Uma Musume: Pretty Derby - Shin Jidai no Tobira","userPreferred":"Umamusume: Pretty Derby - Beginning of a New Era"},"trailer":{"id":"h4dMQOzj-5g","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/h4dMQOzj-5g/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/124223-BY20WcVyVHEA.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#5d93e4","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx124223-XMOEUPopjtrI.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx124223-XMOEUPopjtrI.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx124223-XMOEUPopjtrI.png"},"description":"The second season of \u003ci\u003eUma Musume: Pretty Derby\u003c/i\u003e.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nAll eyes are on Toukai Teiou as she takes on the Japanese Derby, ready to gallop in Symboli Rudolf's footsteps and become an undefeated Triple Crown Horse Girl. The stands are full. The track is set. It's time to see which horse girl fortune favors!\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Crunchyroll, edited)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":30,"month":3,"year":2021},"episodes":13,"format":"TV","genres":["Drama","Slice of Life","Sports"],"id":124223,"idMal":42941,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":83,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"season":"WINTER","seasonYear":2021,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/124223","startDate":{"day":5,"month":1,"year":2021},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["สาวม้าโมเอะ ภาค 2"],"title":{"english":"Umamusume: Pretty Derby Season 2","native":"ウマ娘 プリティーダービー Season 2","romaji":"Uma Musume: Pretty Derby Season 2","userPreferred":"Umamusume: Pretty Derby Season 2"},"trailer":{"id":"1y77CeQmnD8","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/1y77CeQmnD8/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/156632-VZdtKjhrnn4m.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#f1436b","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx156632-QnKMOaso3n2y.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx156632-QnKMOaso3n2y.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx156632-QnKMOaso3n2y.jpg"},"description":"The third season of \u003ci\u003eUma Musume: Pretty Derby\u003c/i\u003e.","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":28,"month":12,"year":2023},"episodes":13,"format":"TV","genres":["Drama","Slice of Life","Sports"],"id":156632,"idMal":53526,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":78,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"season":"FALL","seasonYear":2023,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/156632","startDate":{"day":5,"month":10,"year":2023},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["สาวม้าโมเอะ ภาค 3","賽馬娘Pretty Derby 第3季"],"title":{"english":"Umamusume: Pretty Derby Season 3","native":"ウマ娘 プリティーダービー Season 3","romaji":"Uma Musume: Pretty Derby Season 3","userPreferred":"Umamusume: Pretty Derby Season 3"},"trailer":{"id":"Ne81zmJ36s4","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Ne81zmJ36s4/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/195240-HcuZvXcdT5aX.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#5093e4","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx195240-hKcmllV6YHQT.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx195240-hKcmllV6YHQT.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx195240-hKcmllV6YHQT.jpg"},"description":"The second half of \u003ci\u003eUmamusume: Cinderella Gray\u003c/i\u003e. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\nHailing from the humble countryside, Oguri Cap has turned the racing world on its head. Her rampage through the national race scene seemed unstoppable... until it wasn't. Tamamo Cross, the current peak of racing, has bested the Beast and declared Oguri Cap her rival. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\nBut Oguri Cap can't afford to keep her attention on Tamamo Cross alone. One by one, racers from all over the world arrive in Japan, ready to demonstrate their own prowess. Up against the best the world has to offer, our ashen racer will need to reach beyond her limits if she wants to stand a chance… Keep those eyes peeled—a Cinderella story full of twists and turns lies ahead!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\n(Source: It's Anime powered by REMOW)\n","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":21,"month":12,"year":2025},"episodes":10,"format":"TV","genres":["Drama","Sports"],"id":195240,"idMal":61930,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":86,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"season":"FALL","seasonYear":2025,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/195240","startDate":{"day":5,"month":10,"year":2025},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["Umamusume: Cinderella Gray Cour 2"],"title":{"english":"Umamusume: Cinderella Gray 2nd Cour","native":"ウマ娘 シンデレラグレイ 第2クール","romaji":"Uma Musume: Cinderella Gray Part 2","userPreferred":"Umamusume: Cinderella Gray 2nd Cour"},"trailer":{"id":"MNZchQvbMa0","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/MNZchQvbMa0/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/145608-fA2oldHfsFDp.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#786be4","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx145608-beRhL5C0aO5V.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx145608-beRhL5C0aO5V.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx145608-beRhL5C0aO5V.png"},"description":"Initially unveiled on the Pakatube! Channel's \"Paka Live TV Vol.14 1st Anniversary Special!\" stream, a special animation was shown commemorating the 1st anniversary of the Uma Musume: Pretty Derby mobile game starring Kitasan Black and Satono Diamond.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nThe story begins at the entrance ceremony of the Tracen Academy in spring. Kitasan Black, still unaware of her dream, begins to pursue her aspirations with a clean slate, while Satono Diamond attempts to win the GI to fulfill her family's long-cherished wish. No one knows what the outcome of the race will be for both of them as they set off with their hearts full of hope. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Crunchyroll News, edited)","duration":7,"endDate":{"day":22,"month":2,"year":2022},"episodes":1,"format":"SPECIAL","genres":["Slice of Life","Sports"],"id":145608,"idMal":51225,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":71,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"season":"WINTER","seasonYear":2022,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/145608","startDate":{"day":22,"month":2,"year":2022},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["Uma Musume: Pretty Derby 1st Anniversary PV"],"title":{"english":"Umamusume: Pretty Derby - 1st Anniversary Special Animation","native":"ウマ娘 プリティーダービー 1st Anniversary Special Animation","romaji":"Uma Musume: Pretty Derby - 1st Anniversary Special Animation","userPreferred":"Umamusume: Pretty Derby - 1st Anniversary Special Animation"},"trailer":{"id":"RKVWLnVqnP0","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/RKVWLnVqnP0/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}],"pageInfo":{"currentPage":1,"hasNextPage":false,"lastPage":1,"perPage":48,"total":10}}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T02:27:06.758018231+05:30"},"{\"query\":\"query ListAnime ($page: Int, $search: String, $perPage: Int, $sort: [MediaSort], $status: [MediaStatus], $genres: [String], $tags: [String], $averageScore_greater: Int, $season: MediaSeason, $seasonYear: Int, $format: MediaFormat, $isAdult: Boolean) {\\n\\tPage(page: $page, perPage: $perPage) {\\n\\t\\tpageInfo {\\n\\t\\t\\thasNextPage\\n\\t\\t\\ttotal\\n\\t\\t\\tperPage\\n\\t\\t\\tcurrentPage\\n\\t\\t\\tlastPage\\n\\t\\t}\\n\\t\\tmedia(type: ANIME, search: $search, sort: $sort, status_in: $status, isAdult: $isAdult, format: $format, genre_in: $genres, tag_in: $tags, averageScore_greater: $averageScore_greater, season: $season, seasonYear: $seasonYear, format_not: MUSIC) {\\n\\t\\t\\t... baseAnime\\n\\t\\t}\\n\\t}\\n}\\nfragment baseAnime on Media {\\n\\tid\\n\\tidMal\\n\\tsiteUrl\\n\\tstatus(version: 2)\\n\\tseason\\n\\ttype\\n\\tformat\\n\\tseasonYear\\n\\tbannerImage\\n\\tepisodes\\n\\tsynonyms\\n\\tisAdult\\n\\tcountryOfOrigin\\n\\tmeanScore\\n\\tdescription\\n\\tgenres\\n\\tduration\\n\\ttrailer {\\n\\t\\tid\\n\\t\\tsite\\n\\t\\tthumbnail\\n\\t}\\n\\ttitle {\\n\\t\\tuserPreferred\\n\\t\\tromaji\\n\\t\\tenglish\\n\\t\\tnative\\n\\t}\\n\\tcoverImage {\\n\\t\\textraLarge\\n\\t\\tlarge\\n\\t\\tmedium\\n\\t\\tcolor\\n\\t}\\n\\tstartDate {\\n\\t\\tyear\\n\\t\\tmonth\\n\\t\\tday\\n\\t}\\n\\tendDate {\\n\\t\\tyear\\n\\t\\tmonth\\n\\t\\tday\\n\\t}\\n\\tnextAiringEpisode {\\n\\t\\tairingAt\\n\\t\\ttimeUntilAiring\\n\\t\\tepisode\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\",\"variables\":{\"page\":1,\"perPage\":20,\"sort\":[\"TRENDING_DESC\"]}}":{"value":{"Page":{"media":[{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/195600-UxHvDXwzJxlP.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e49335","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx195600-moI0UFArtOme.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx195600-moI0UFArtOme.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx195600-moI0UFArtOme.jpg"},"description":"In a remote mountain village under the watchful eyes of two stone guardians, the young Yuru contentedly lives off the land while staying close to the only family he has left—Asa, his precious twin sister. Asa, meanwhile, carries out a mysterious “duty” on behalf of the village while locked in a cage. Why is Asa a prisoner? And what other secrets does Yuru’s otherwise idyllic home hide?\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e(Source: Square Enix)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":null,"month":null,"year":null},"episodes":24,"format":"TV","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy","Supernatural"],"id":195600,"idMal":62001,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":78,"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1784385000,"episode":15,"timeUntilAiring":591822},"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2026,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/195600","startDate":{"day":4,"month":4,"year":2026},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":["ヨミツガ","YomiTsuga","Pasangan dari Alam Baka","ยมลแห่งยมโลก","Daemons do Reino das Sombras","Espíritus del Inframundo"],"title":{"english":"Daemons of the Shadow Realm","native":"黄泉のツガイ","romaji":"Yomi no Tsugai","userPreferred":"Daemons of the Shadow Realm"},"trailer":{"id":"XCyj9KKKjUI","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/XCyj9KKKjUI/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/187538-287evzCezNl0.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#435dff","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx187538-fXVXKYUA3VV6.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx187538-fXVXKYUA3VV6.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx187538-fXVXKYUA3VV6.jpg"},"description":"Jirou Azuma is no average high schooler. A descendant of ninjas and trained in the ancient warrior art of the shinobi, Jirou is also able to talk with animals. After a mysterious encounter with an injured cat named Ragou, Jirou discovers the feline is actually the legendary Black Star of Doom! Joined by the Bureau of Espionage, they fight off swarms of mononoke lying in wait to exploit Ragou’s powers.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Crunchyroll)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":null,"month":null,"year":null},"episodes":null,"format":"TV","genres":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy","Sci-Fi","Supernatural"],"id":187538,"idMal":61169,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":73,"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1784379600,"episode":3,"timeUntilAiring":586422},"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2026,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/187538","startDate":{"day":4,"month":7,"year":2026},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":["ブラックトーチ"],"title":{"english":"BLACK TORCH","native":"BLACK TORCH","romaji":"BLACK TORCH","userPreferred":"BLACK TORCH"},"trailer":{"id":"2clp09dITKY","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/2clp09dITKY/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/182205-fRUoKv6f2JAq.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#1abbd6","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx182205-q2AeO1owuQbO.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx182205-q2AeO1owuQbO.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx182205-q2AeO1owuQbO.jpg"},"description":"The fourth season of \u003ci\u003eTensei Shitara Slime Datta Ken\u003c/i\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nDemon Lord Rimuru's dream of creating an alliance between humans and monsters takes a step closer to being realized. As Tempest continues to prosper, Granville Rozzo and his granddaughter, Maribel Rozzo, clash with Demon Lord Rimuru over their plan to protect mankind by ruling over them. Meanwhile, in El Dorado, Demon Lord Leon works toward goals of his own. The awakening of a new Hero draws near!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll News)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":null,"month":null,"year":null},"episodes":null,"format":"TV","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"],"id":182205,"idMal":59970,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":82,"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1784296800,"episode":15,"timeUntilAiring":503622},"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2026,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/182205","startDate":{"day":3,"month":4,"year":2026},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":["Tensura 4","転スラ 4","เกิดใหม่ทั้งทีก็เป็นสไลม์ไปซะแล้ว ซีซั่น 4","О моём перерождении в слизь 4","Aquella vez que me convertí en slime - Temporada 4"],"title":{"english":"That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime Season 4","native":"転生したらスライムだった件 第4期","romaji":"Tensei Shitara Slime Datta Ken 4th Season","userPreferred":"That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime Season 4"},"trailer":{"id":"ikxIrDr72iA","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ikxIrDr72iA/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/190569-fQrApHKs9PIz.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#50a1e4","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx190569-KnCQLI3Z8hPX.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx190569-KnCQLI3Z8hPX.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx190569-KnCQLI3Z8hPX.jpg"},"description":"After losing her mother and her homeland, Sitara’s despair transforms into determination with the power of knowledge. New possibilities unfold when a family of scholars takes her in, deepening her education. Meanwhile, Genghis Khan’s Mongol Empire conquers nation after nation, nearing Sitara’s new home. After the Fourth Prince of the empire takes her captive, a flame of revenge is ignited.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Crunchyroll)","duration":23,"endDate":{"day":null,"month":null,"year":null},"episodes":null,"format":"TV","genres":["Drama"],"id":190569,"idMal":61483,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":81,"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1784385000,"episode":4,"timeUntilAiring":591822},"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2026,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/190569","startDate":{"day":4,"month":7,"year":2026},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":["A Witch's Life in Mongol","Jaadugar, la légende de Fatima"],"title":{"english":"Jaadugar: A Witch in Mongolia","native":"天幕のジャードゥーガル","romaji":"Tenmaku no Jaadugar","userPreferred":"Jaadugar: A Witch in Mongolia"},"trailer":{"id":"GBHYXPp1lt8","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/GBHYXPp1lt8/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/171110-lgtmKokpevUM.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#5daee4","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx171110-7zOdInS6DQNL.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx171110-7zOdInS6DQNL.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx171110-7zOdInS6DQNL.jpg"},"description":"Anime adaptation of Part 3 of \u003ci\u003eHonzuki no Gekokujou\u003c/i\u003e.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nFollowing a disastrous encounter with a noble, Myne finally resolves to say goodbye to her family and friends in the lower city, changing her name to “Rozemyne” and beginning her new life as the adopted daughter of Ehrenfest’s archduke. However, her days as an archnoble in noble society are brutal, as she is put through rigorous etiquette and magic training on top of her duties as High Bishop and forewoman. It all proves too much for a weak little seven-year-old girl... Or it would have, had the High Priest not offered her the keys to the temple’s book room as a reward. If she could get her hands on those, she’d be able to read all sorts of precious books! Her name may have changed, but Rozemyne’s passion for books remains the same as she charges into a whole new world! The detailed setting expands as the printing industry grows in size. Here begins Part 3 of this biblio-fantasy for book lovers everywhere!\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: J-Novel Club)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":null,"month":null,"year":null},"episodes":null,"format":"TV","genres":["Drama","Fantasy","Slice of Life"],"id":171110,"idMal":57466,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":77,"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1784363400,"episode":14,"timeUntilAiring":570222},"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2026,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/171110","startDate":{"day":4,"month":4,"year":2026},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":["Ascendance of a Bookworm Season 4","本好きの下剋上 司書になるためには手段を選んでいられません 第4期","Honzuki no Gekokujou: Shisho ni Naru Tame ni wa Shudan wo Erandeiraremasen 4th Season"],"title":{"english":"Ascendance of a Bookworm: Adopted Daughter of an Archduke","native":"本好きの下剋上 領主の養女","romaji":"Honzuki no Gekokujou: Ryoushu no Youjo","userPreferred":"Ascendance of a Bookworm: Adopted Daughter of an Archduke"},"trailer":{"id":"rtPF6rjrdSU","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/rtPF6rjrdSU/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/186863-hRsC2yxvILTx.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e4e45d","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx186863-AO4efoB8HuzA.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx186863-AO4efoB8HuzA.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx186863-AO4efoB8HuzA.png"},"description":"The story follows a fire-breathing, human-hating dragon raised by a mother cat in a forest. The dragon, known affectionately as \"Uncle Wing,\" watches over the many curious cats — such as one that goes on an adventure with a human prince, and another that lives in the city and people-watches as a hobby — and gradually warms up to humans along the way.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll News)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003ci\u003eNote: Each episode streamed 1 week early on ABEMA and dAnimeStore. The original TV broadcast started on July 4, 2026.\u003c/i\u003e","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":null,"month":null,"year":null},"episodes":null,"format":"ONA","genres":["Adventure","Fantasy"],"id":186863,"idMal":61048,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":75,"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1784376000,"episode":4,"timeUntilAiring":582822},"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2026,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/186863","startDate":{"day":27,"month":6,"year":2026},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":[],"title":{"english":"The Cat and the Dragon","native":"猫と竜","romaji":"Neko to Ryuu","userPreferred":"The Cat and the Dragon"},"trailer":{"id":"xi4rGcyeYr8","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/xi4rGcyeYr8/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":null,"countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#ff7835","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b194219-56EhyK775lga.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b194219-56EhyK775lga.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b194219-56EhyK775lga.jpg"},"description":"A Japanese-style ayakashi Cinderella story! \u003ci\u003e\"You're the bride I've been searching for all this time.\"\u003c/i\u003e The ayakashi and humans coexist in harmony. The ayakashi, having superior abilities and beautiful appearances, sometimes find their partner among human women, making them their \"bride\". The bride, in exchange for bringing prosperity, receives absolute love from the ayakashi. Yuzu is constantly compared to her sister, a bride of a demon fox, and is resented by her family every day. One day, when Yuzu just couldn't take things anymore, a man appears before her on a bridge. This man is the most beautiful man Yuzu has ever seen... and he's calling her his wife?! \u003ci\u003e\"Just be quiet and let me hold you.\"\u003c/i\u003e The most powerful, \"cold-hearted\" ayakashi is pouring his heart out for Yuzu?!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: MangaPlaza)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":20,"month":9,"year":2026},"episodes":12,"format":"TV","genres":["Drama","Fantasy","Romance"],"id":194219,"idMal":61814,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":71,"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1784388600,"episode":3,"timeUntilAiring":595422},"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2026,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/194219","startDate":{"day":5,"month":7,"year":2026},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":["OniHana"],"title":{"english":"The Ogre's Bride","native":"鬼の花嫁","romaji":"Oni no Hanayome","userPreferred":"The Ogre's Bride"},"trailer":{"id":"1hYWc5MCIPk","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/1hYWc5MCIPk/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21-wf37VakJmZqs.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e49335","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx21-ELSYx3yMPcKM.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx21-ELSYx3yMPcKM.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx21-ELSYx3yMPcKM.jpg"},"description":"Gold Roger was known as the Pirate King, the strongest and most infamous being to have sailed the Grand Line. The capture and death of Roger by the World Government brought a change throughout the world. His last words before his death revealed the location of the greatest treasure in the world, One Piece. It was this revelation that brought about the Grand Age of Pirates, men who dreamed of finding One Piece (which promises an unlimited amount of riches and fame), and quite possibly the most coveted of titles for the person who found it, the title of the Pirate King.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nEnter Monkey D. Luffy, a 17-year-old boy that defies your standard definition of a pirate. Rather than the popular persona of a wicked, hardened, toothless pirate who ransacks villages for fun, Luffy’s reason for being a pirate is one of pure wonder; the thought of an exciting adventure and meeting new and intriguing people, along with finding One Piece, are his reasons of becoming a pirate. Following in the footsteps of his childhood hero, Luffy and his crew travel across the Grand Line, experiencing crazy adventures, unveiling dark mysteries and battling strong enemies, all in order to reach One Piece.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cb\u003e*This includes the following special episodes:\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n- Chopperman to the Rescue! Protect the TV Station by the Shore! (Episode 336)\u003cbr\u003e\n- The Strongest Tag-Team! Luffy and Toriko's Hard Struggle! (Episode 492)\u003cbr\u003e\n- Team Formation! Save Chopper (Episode 542)\u003cbr\u003e\n- History's Strongest Collaboration vs. Glutton of the Sea (Episode 590)\u003cbr\u003e\n- 20th Anniversary! Special Romance Dawn (Episode 907)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":null,"month":null,"year":null},"episodes":null,"format":"TV","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Drama","Fantasy"],"id":21,"idMal":21,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":87,"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1783865760,"episode":1169,"timeUntilAiring":72582},"season":"FALL","seasonYear":1999,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/21","startDate":{"day":20,"month":10,"year":1999},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":["ワンピース","海贼王","וואן פיס","ون بيس","วันพีซ","Vua Hải Tặc","All'arrembaggio!","Tutti all'arrembaggio!","Ντρέηκ, το Κυνήγι του Θησαυρού","OP","Ван-Пис"],"title":{"english":"ONE PIECE","native":"ONE PIECE","romaji":"ONE PIECE","userPreferred":"ONE PIECE"},"trailer":null,"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/184492-JsZazzn4Acqf.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#f1bb28","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx184492-KUVFGieuMaOx.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx184492-KUVFGieuMaOx.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx184492-KUVFGieuMaOx.jpg"},"description":"The fourth season of \u003ci\u003eMairimashita! Iruma-kun.\u003c/i\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nSuzuki Iruma and all thirteen students of the Misfit Class must perform to reach Rank 4 at the Music Festival.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Crunchyroll News)","duration":25,"endDate":{"day":null,"month":null,"year":null},"episodes":24,"format":"TV","genres":["Comedy","Fantasy","Supernatural"],"id":184492,"idMal":60310,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":81,"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1784366760,"episode":16,"timeUntilAiring":573582},"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2026,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/184492","startDate":{"day":4,"month":4,"year":2026},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":["อิรุมะคุง ผจญในแดนปีศาจ ซีซั่น 4"],"title":{"english":"Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun Season 4","native":"魔入りました！入間くん 第4シリーズ","romaji":"Mairimashita! Iruma-kun 4","userPreferred":"Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun Season 4"},"trailer":{"id":"6Lo1DUCY9nY","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/6Lo1DUCY9nY/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/196187-Z9dV6uotmKjM.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#f1c9bb","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx196187-0dgFi2CPp3xn.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx196187-0dgFi2CPp3xn.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx196187-0dgFi2CPp3xn.jpg"},"description":"At age forty-five, office worker Sasaki has had enough of the corporate grind. His only solace is smoking-and the friendly smile of supermarket cashier Yamada. When Sasaki can't find Yamada after a particularly trying day, a striking woman invites him to smoke with her. The despondent man thinks he's made a new smoking buddy in the cool, teasing Tayama, but Sasaki doesn't realize he already knows her!\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Square Enix)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\n\u003ci\u003eNote: Episodes 1-6 had an early release by ABEMA and Crunchyroll on June 3rd, 2026 in a mini-episode batch format that splits 6 episodes into 12, ahead of the TV broadcast which started on July 9th, 2026.\u003c/i\u003e","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":null,"month":null,"year":null},"episodes":12,"format":"TV","genres":["Comedy","Romance","Slice of Life"],"id":196187,"idMal":62076,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":83,"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1784213760,"episode":2,"timeUntilAiring":420582},"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2026,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/196187","startDate":{"day":9,"month":7,"year":2026},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":["Behind the supermarket, smoking with you.","ヤニすう","YaniSuu","Paląc z tobą na tyłach sklepu","สองสิงห์อมควันหลังซูเปอร์มาร์เก็ต"],"title":{"english":"Smoking Behind the Supermarket with You","native":"スーパーの裏でヤニ吸うふたり","romaji":"Super no Ura de Yani Suu Futari","userPreferred":"Smoking Behind the Supermarket with You"},"trailer":{"id":"aOOwNK6Ul6E","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/aOOwNK6Ul6E/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":null,"countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#0dbbf1","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx209983-sFOcKyqMufxb.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx209983-sFOcKyqMufxb.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx209983-sFOcKyqMufxb.jpg"},"description":"The second season of \u003ci\u003eHell Mode\u003c/i\u003e.","duration":25,"endDate":{"day":null,"month":null,"year":null},"episodes":13,"format":"TV","genres":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy"],"id":209983,"idMal":63817,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":74,"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1784304000,"episode":3,"timeUntilAiring":510822},"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2026,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/209983","startDate":{"day":4,"month":7,"year":2026},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":["HELL MODE: The Hardcore Gamer Dominates in Another World with Garbage Balancing Season 2","HELL MODE ~อยากเล่นโหด ขอโหมดนรก~ ซีซั่น 2"],"title":{"english":"HELL MODE: The Hardcore Gamer Dominates in Another World with Garbage Balancing Season 2","native":"ヘルモード ～やり込み好きのゲーマーは廃設定の異世界で無双する～ 2nd Season","romaji":"Hell Mode: Yarikomi-zuki no Gamer wa Haisettei no Isekai de Musou Suru 2nd Season","userPreferred":"HELL MODE: The Hardcore Gamer Dominates in Another World with Garbage Balancing Season 2"},"trailer":{"id":"hr_7R76pUC8","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/hr_7R76pUC8/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":null,"countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#f1ae1a","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx196017-GynDNdbDzqzk.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx196017-GynDNdbDzqzk.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx196017-GynDNdbDzqzk.jpg"},"description":"The anime's story is set in the late 1950s and early 1960s, during the height of Japan's economic boom, when the circus is a major form of entertainment. Different circus troupes travel throughout Japan to perform and compete for a chance to participate in the world-renowned festival called \"Circus Collection.\" One troupe called the \"Sunflower Circus,\" led by its ringmaster Maria, travels around Japan to perform, despite struggling with financial difficulties. However, they meet a circus prodigy named Mizuka Tsurumaki. This is the story of a one-of-a-kind circus show of young girls with big dreams.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Anime News Network)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":null,"month":null,"year":null},"episodes":null,"format":"TV","genres":[],"id":196017,"idMal":62051,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":72,"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1784386800,"episode":3,"timeUntilAiring":593622},"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2026,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/196017","startDate":{"day":5,"month":7,"year":2026},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":[],"title":{"english":"Grow Up Show","native":"グロウアップショウ ～ひまわりのサーカス団～","romaji":"Grow Up Show: Himawari no Circus-dan","userPreferred":"Grow Up Show"},"trailer":{"id":"PAneuhZLHzU","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/PAneuhZLHzU/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/269-08ar2HJOUAuL.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#f1a150","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx269-d2GmRkJbMopq.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx269-d2GmRkJbMopq.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx269-d2GmRkJbMopq.png"},"description":"Ichigo Kurosaki is a rather normal high school student apart from the fact he has the ability to see ghosts. This ability never impacted his life in a major way until the day he encounters the Shinigami Kuchiki Rukia, who saves him and his family's lives from a Hollow, a corrupt spirit that devours human souls. \n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nWounded during the fight against the Hollow, Rukia chooses the only option available to defeat the monster and passes her Shinigami powers to Ichigo. Now forced to act as a substitute until Rukia recovers, Ichigo hunts down the Hollows that plague his town. \n\n\n","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":27,"month":3,"year":2012},"episodes":366,"format":"TV","genres":["Action","Adventure","Supernatural"],"id":269,"idMal":269,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":79,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"season":"FALL","seasonYear":2004,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/269","startDate":{"day":5,"month":10,"year":2004},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["ブリーチ","'בליץ","เทพมรณะ","بليتش","Блич"],"title":{"english":"Bleach","native":"BLEACH","romaji":"BLEACH","userPreferred":"Bleach"},"trailer":{"id":"0c4IoCA5fY0","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0c4IoCA5fY0/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/207141-MvHAS2YVfJzL.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#50a1f1","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx207141-h5q5KJPd6vaX.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx207141-h5q5KJPd6vaX.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx207141-h5q5KJPd6vaX.jpg"},"description":"Yani is a catgirl with a seriously bad smoking habit. She smokes so much that her apartment smells like ash and is littered with cigarette butts—and plenty of other trash! Every time she tries to quit, she becomes weak to the cravings and gives in almost instantly. Will she ever get her life together, or is she doomed to live as a chainsmoking slob forever? \n\u003cBR\u003e\u003cBR\u003e\n(Source: Seven Seas Entertainment)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":null,"month":null,"year":null},"episodes":null,"format":"TV","genres":["Comedy","Slice of Life"],"id":207141,"idMal":63403,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":68,"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1784215800,"episode":3,"timeUntilAiring":422622},"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2026,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/207141","startDate":{"day":3,"month":7,"year":2026},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":["แมวสาวอมควัน"],"title":{"english":"Chainsmoker Cat","native":"ヤニねこ","romaji":"Yani Neko","userPreferred":"Chainsmoker Cat"},"trailer":{"id":"KYGgyQtSAdI","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/KYGgyQtSAdI/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/147105-fTjmRrILFixZ.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#0d8693","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx147105-rwOX8qyUy8gV.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx147105-rwOX8qyUy8gV.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx147105-rwOX8qyUy8gV.jpg"},"description":"In a world where everyone takes wonders like magic spells and dragons for granted, Coco is a girl with a simple dream: she wants to be a witch. But everybody knows magicians are born, not made, and Coco was not born with a gift for magic. Resigned to her un-magical life, Coco is about to give up on her dream to become a witch … until the day she meets Qifrey, a mysterious, traveling magician. After secretly seeing Qifrey perform magic in a way she’s never seen before, Coco soon learns what everybody “knows” might not be the truth, and discovers that her magical dream may not be as far away as it may seem... \u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Kodansha USA) \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\n\u003ci\u003eNote: Tongari Boushi no Atelier episode 2 was streamed a week in advance on Crunchyroll, ABEMA, and Netflix, alongside episode 1. Streaming is one week ahead of the TV broadcast.\u003c/i\u003e","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":22,"month":6,"year":2026},"episodes":13,"format":"ONA","genres":["Adventure","Drama","Fantasy"],"id":147105,"idMal":51553,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":85,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2026,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/147105","startDate":{"day":6,"month":4,"year":2026},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["Atelier of Witch Hat"," จอมเวทฝึกหัดกับหมวกมหัศจรรย์","Atelier spiczastych kapeluszy","Cadı Şapkası Atölyesi","L'Atelier des Sorciers","Xưởng Phép Thuật","Ателье колдовских колпаков"],"title":{"english":"Witch Hat Atelier","native":"とんがり帽子のアトリエ","romaji":"Tongari Boushi no Atelier","userPreferred":"Witch Hat Atelier"},"trailer":{"id":"rc26AwBXlUE","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/rc26AwBXlUE/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/178789-9nHWmoRLlcLu.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#28bbe4","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx178789-hNXjKFzUq7mk.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx178789-hNXjKFzUq7mk.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx178789-hNXjKFzUq7mk.jpg"},"description":"The third season of \u003ci\u003eMushoku Tensei: Isekai Ittara Honki Dasu\u003c/i\u003e.","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":null,"month":null,"year":null},"episodes":14,"format":"TV","genres":["Adventure","Drama","Ecchi","Fantasy"],"id":178789,"idMal":59193,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":87,"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1783868400,"episode":3,"timeUntilAiring":75222},"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2026,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/178789","startDate":{"day":4,"month":7,"year":2026},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":["Mushoku Tensei: Jobless Reincarnation Season 3","無職転生 ～異世界行ったら本気だす～ 第3期","Mushoku Tensei: Isekai Ittara Honki Dasu 3rd Season","เกิดชาตินี้พี่ต้องเทพ ซีซั่น 3"],"title":{"english":"Mushoku Tensei: Jobless Reincarnation Season 3","native":"無職転生Ⅲ ～異世界行ったら本気だす～","romaji":"Mushoku Tensei III: Isekai Ittara Honki Dasu","userPreferred":"Mushoku Tensei: Jobless Reincarnation Season 3"},"trailer":{"id":"ODxfIvSgWuo","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ODxfIvSgWuo/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":null,"countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#5dd6f1","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx199748-PAFk9pGSUmFL.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx199748-PAFk9pGSUmFL.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx199748-PAFk9pGSUmFL.png"},"description":"Luck, an S-rank mage in the hero’s party, makes a last stand against the Demon King to save his companions. When he finally returns victorious, ten years have passed, and the world praises him as a legendary hero who died in battle. Unable to reclaim his former life, Luck conceals his identity and begins again as “Lock,” an F-rank adventurer forging a future in a world that moved on without him.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Crunchyroll)\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\n\u003ci\u003eNote: Koko wa Ore ni Makasete Saki ni Ike to Ittekara 10-nen ga Tattara Densetsu ni Natteita is streaming 3 days in advance of the TV broadcast on Prime Video beginning July 3rd, 2026. Regular broadcasting began on July 6th, 2026.\u003c/i\u003e","duration":23,"endDate":{"day":null,"month":null,"year":null},"episodes":12,"format":"ONA","genres":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy"],"id":199748,"idMal":62617,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":68,"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1784295000,"episode":3,"timeUntilAiring":501822},"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2026,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/199748","startDate":{"day":3,"month":7,"year":2026},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":["KokoOre","ここ俺"],"title":{"english":"I Became a Legend After My 10 Year-Long Last Stand","native":"ここは俺に任せて先に行けと言ってから１０年がたったら伝説になっていた。","romaji":"Koko wa Ore ni Makasete Saki ni Ike to Ittekara 10-nen ga Tattara Densetsu ni Natteita.","userPreferred":"I Became a Legend After My 10 Year-Long Last Stand"},"trailer":{"id":"_9FRdFYJOdg","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_9FRdFYJOdg/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/196218-lX0y9T76KQkC.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#febb50","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx196218-UsdTTCrwpDIN.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx196218-UsdTTCrwpDIN.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx196218-UsdTTCrwpDIN.jpg"},"description":"Dias finally returns home after decades of war. He's hailed as a hero and promptly rewarded with his own domain...which turns out to be little more than empty plains. Population: zero. Dias, who has only ever known battle, finds himself at a loss. How is he supposed to survive, let alone cultivate his territory into a thriving, prosperous dominion when there's nothing but grass as far as can see? \n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nFortunately for Dias, a horned girl by the name of Alna is about to show him there's more to the plains than meets the eye! \n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: J-Novel Club)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\n\u003ci\u003eNote: Ryoumin 0-Nin Start no Henkyou Ryoushu-sama is streaming a week advance of the TV broadcast on Prime Video beginning July 3rd, 2026. Regular broadcasting began on July 10th, 2026.\u003c/i\u003e","duration":25,"endDate":{"day":null,"month":null,"year":null},"episodes":null,"format":"ONA","genres":["Action","Comedy","Drama","Fantasy","Romance","Slice of Life"],"id":196218,"idMal":62078,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":69,"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1784295000,"episode":3,"timeUntilAiring":501822},"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2026,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/196218","startDate":{"day":3,"month":7,"year":2026},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":["The Frontier Lord Begins with Zero Subjects: Tales of Blue Dias and the Beastkin Alna","The Population of the Frontier Owner Stars with 0.","Penguasa Negeri Terluar Memulai dari 0 Rakyat","ได้เป็นถึงท่านเจ้าครอบครองดินแดน แต่ดันมีพลเมืองเริ่มต้นจากศูนย์ซะงั้น"],"title":{"english":"The Frontier Lord Begins with Zero Subjects","native":"領民0人スタートの辺境領主様","romaji":"Ryoumin 0-Nin Start no Henkyou Ryoushu-sama","userPreferred":"The Frontier Lord Begins with Zero Subjects"},"trailer":{"id":"5JpTU6wj_-g","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/5JpTU6wj_-g/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":null,"countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e4bb28","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx208225-HJbCC0Z4xRp3.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx208225-HJbCC0Z4xRp3.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx208225-HJbCC0Z4xRp3.jpg"},"description":"Elsa, the daughter of a fallen aristocrat, receives news. It was a marriage proposal from Julius, a very elite nobleman. Elsa is wondering,\" Why would such a distinguished man marry me\"? But after the wedding, Julius, who had been kind and gentle up to that point, changed completely! In a cold voice, he tells her,\" I have no intention of loving you\".\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: MangaPlaza)","duration":23,"endDate":{"day":null,"month":null,"year":null},"episodes":12,"format":"TV","genres":["Fantasy","Romance"],"id":208225,"idMal":63537,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":64,"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1784392200,"episode":3,"timeUntilAiring":599022},"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2026,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/208225","startDate":{"day":5,"month":7,"year":2026},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":["きみ愛","KimiAi"],"title":{"english":"The Duke’s Son Claims He Won’t Love Me Yet Showers Me with Adoration","native":"「きみを愛する気はない」と言った次期公爵様がなぜか溺愛してきます","romaji":"\"Kimi wo Aisuru Ki wa nai\" to Itta Jiki Koushaku-sama ga Naze ka Dekiai Shitekimasu","userPreferred":"The Duke’s Son Claims He Won’t Love Me Yet Showers Me with Adoration"},"trailer":{"id":"MNzf8UswtzI","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/MNzf8UswtzI/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},{"bannerImage":null,"countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#50c9fe","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx180136-gtMTCRlOD4OE.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx180136-gtMTCRlOD4OE.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx180136-gtMTCRlOD4OE.jpg"},"description":"Born into a prestigious family of master swordsmen, Elymas Edvaughn’s future shatters when he awakens the so-called “defective” Heavy Knight class. Disowned and cast out, he regains memories of another life—and realizes this world mirrors a VR game he once mastered. Armed with knowledge no one else possesses, he sets out to rewrite his fate and prove the strength of the “weakest” class.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Crunchyroll)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":25,"month":12,"year":2026},"episodes":26,"format":"TV","genres":["Action","Fantasy"],"id":180136,"idMal":59741,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":69,"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1784215560,"episode":3,"timeUntilAiring":422382},"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2026,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/180136","startDate":{"day":3,"month":7,"year":2026},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":["The Exiled Reincarnated Heavy Knight Is Unrivaled in Game Knowledge","Juukishi","Kesatria Kelas Berat Tereinkarnasi yang Diasingkan Jadi Tanpa Tanding Dengan Pengetahuan Gimnya","เกิดใหม่เป็นอัศวินเกราะหนักผู้ถูกขับไล่แต่ใช้ความรู้จากเกมจนไร้เทียมทาน"],"title":{"english":"The Exiled Heavy Knight Knows How to Game the System","native":"追放された転生重騎士はゲーム知識で無双する","romaji":"Tsuihou Sareta Tensei Juukishi wa Game Chishiki de Musou Suru","userPreferred":"The Exiled Heavy Knight Knows How to Game the System"},"trailer":{"id":"uC13b3_8riU","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/uC13b3_8riU/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}],"pageInfo":{"currentPage":1,"hasNextPage":true,"lastPage":250,"perPage":20,"total":5000}}},"updated_at":"2026-07-11T23:36:20.10012657+05:30"}}
